y  sites to find an image to start with  something like this I probably would  have searched for Rose images which I  then would have cut out and duplicated I  would have searched for field images  maybe poppy fields whatever it is to  create a field here and then I would  have searched for you know castles and  backgrounds and things like that to blur  out and put in the background plus skies  I would have had to composite this  entire image to get gather from multiple  photographs or 3D renders to create this  it would have taken me hours if not days  to do that with AI I can create an image  like this within seconds AI is not going  to replace motion designers anytime soon  in fact AI can actually help us become  better at our craft so if your emotion  is iron don't be afraid to embrace Ai  and use it to your advantage remember  that AI can be your ally not your enemy  I hope that you really enjoy this lesson  as much as I loved teaching it so please  let me know if you have any questions in  the comments below I'd love to answer  them for you hit that like button if you  enjoyed this video and please subscribe  to this channel it helps other people  find this channel as well if you're  looking to upgrade your design skill set  master the art of style and execute like  a pro I have a course called stylecraft  that you can check out at  motionscience.tv you can also learn more  about this course by clicking the link  in the description below as always  thanks for watching my name is Cameron  and this is motion  [Music]  foreign  [Music]
 

